      <tr><td>Spocket</td><td>Dropshipping</td><td>Free tier; Starter $39.99, Pro $59.99, Empire $99.99/mo</td><td>Suppliers in the US and Europe.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Syncee</td><td>Dropshipping</td><td>Free for 25 products; Basic $39.99, Pro $59.99, Business $99.99/mo</td><td>Suppliers in the US, Canada, EU, UK and Australia.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>DSers</td><td>Dropshipping</td><td>Basic free; Advanced $19.90, Pro $49.90/mo</td><td>AliExpress, so China-direct. Duties, fees and delays now apply. Not a beginner door.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Shopify Collective</td><td>Dropshipping</td><td>Free, built into Shopify</td><td>Sell other Shopify brands' products; they ship. Both stores need a paid plan, Shopify Payments, and the same country and currency.</td></tr>
